    "d6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Trying to win the pawn back gives it up for nothing, so the aim is to trade on your own terms — and the way to do that is to develop a piece to f4, inviting the opponent to be the one who captures and steers into a queen trade.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 53.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/ppp2ppp/2np4/4P3/5B2/5N2/PPP1PPPP/RN1QKB1R b KQkq - 1 4",
