   "fen": "r2qkbnr/ppp2ppp/2np4/4P3/5Bb1/5N2/PPP1PPPP/RN1QKB1R w KQkq - 2 5",
   "line": [
    "Bg4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Capturing on d6 is better than letting the bishop develop, because however the opponent recaptures — pawn or bishop — they're saddled with a backward, sickly pawn. Choose the exchange that leaves the enemy structure worst.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
