   "fen": "2kr1b1r/pp3ppp/1qn2n2/3p4/1P3Bb1/P1N1PN2/2P2PPP/1R1QKB1R b K - 0 10",
   "line": [
    "b4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now the sting — look hard at that queen and count its squares. It has only two, c5 and a5, so a pawn thrust to b4 snatches both away. Take a piece's escape squares before you spring the net.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
   "ply": 20,
   "t": 286,
   "fen": "2kr1b1r/pp3ppp/1qn2n2/8/1P1p1Bb1/P1N1PN2/2P2PPP/1R1QKB1R w K - 0 11",
