   "line": [],
   "spoken": "Against the sister trap — the bishop out to c5 with a quick d6 and a knight to e7 — the poison is that capturing the knight allows a bishop check on f2 and a capture that wins the queen. So never take there. Instead trade on your own terms, developing the bishop to f4 to bait a pawn recapture that damages the enemy structure, exactly as before.",
   "kind": "tactic",
